#
# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `scripts/run_native_smoke.sh --sanitize`.
#
# The ASan runtime is preloaded into an uninstrumented Godot, so it sees every
# allocation in the process, not just this extension's. Suppress only leaks
# that cannot involve this project's code, and say why for each entry. Never
# suppress GLib or GIO wholesale: a GVariant or GError this extension forgets
# to free is allocated inside GLib, and that is exactly what the job is for.
# A suppression matches when the pattern appears in any frame of the stack.

# Godot's font backend leaks fontconfig patterns when it enumerates system
# fonts (seen with the official 4.4.1 binary, which dlopens fontconfig). The
# extension never calls fontconfig.
leak:libfontconfig.so
